    "saving_throw_raw": null,
    "spell_resistance_raw": null,
    "description_raw": "While protected by fastidiousness, your person and your equipment stay clean and dry. Dust and moisture slough off immediately; even when you are completely soiled, your appearance reverts to a pristine state over the course of 1 minute.\n\nWhile this spell offers no protection against most attacks, staying constantly sanitary grants you a +2 circumstance bonus on Fortitude saving throws against inhaled and ingested diseases.\n\nMembers of the Sanctified Prophet prestige class can cast this spell, even though it is not a divination or enchantment.",
